.Dd November 5, 2026
.Dt RMDIR 1
.Os ABSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm rmdir
.Nd remove empty directories
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl p
.Ar directory ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Remove each named empty directory. Files and nonempty directories are refused.
With
.Fl p ,
remove each directory and then its empty parents, stopping at a failure,
.Cm . ,
or the root directory.
Other operands are still attempted after an error.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Zero if all requested removals succeed, nonzero on error or invalid arguments.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
mkdir /home/operator/empty
rmdir /home/operator/empty
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mkdir 1 ,
.Xr rm 1 ,
.Xr sbase 7
